        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ American Eagle 6200 Series Heavy Duty Fire Door Rim Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty rim exit device for  use on \"Fire Labeled\" medium and high traffic commercial, hospitality, institutional applications. Suitable for all doors (aluminum, hollow metal, or wood), durable enough for the most demanding applications. Available in your choice of Satin Chrome, Polished Brass, Satin Brass, Satin Stainless Steel or Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor <b>27\" - 36\" Wide Fire Doors</b>, furnished standard with sex nuts. Listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure. ANSI/BHMA <b>Certified Grade 1</b>, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices. “Fire Exit Hardware” labeled for up to 3 hours, Non-handed. reversible for left or right hand doors. Compliant with the 2014 Florida Building Code, which include a High Velocity Hurricane Zone (HVHZ) Product Approval: FL 21376\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for PDQ 6200 Series Rim Exit Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Chassis:</b> Cadmium plated steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Rail:</b> Extruded aluminum</li>\r\n<li><b>Touch Pad:</b> Stainless steel, 18\" wide</li>\r\n<li><b>Latch Bolt:</b> Stainless steel dead locking with 3/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li><b>Projection:</b> 3-1/8” projection / 1-5/8” projection when dogged</li>\r\n<li><b>Hand:</b> Device is non-handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Dogging:</b> None (Fire rated, non-dogging)</li>\r\n<li><b>Application:</b> Rim  (8'0\" tall door standard) / Covers 161 door prep</li>\r\n<li><b>Stile Width:</b> 4-1/4\" minimum</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Thickness:</b> 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Door Width:</b> Standard for 2'3\" to 3'0\" door (27\" - 36\" wide door)</li>\r\n<li><b>Certifications:</b> U.L./U.L.C. listed for “Panic”, “Fire Exit hardware” labeled for up to 3 hour for 4’0” x 8’0” maximum single, 8’0” x 8’0”\r\nmaximum pairs / Complies with U.L. 10C and UBC 7.2 (1997).  ANSI/BHMA Certified Grade 1, A156.3 2001 Exit Devices.</li>\r\n<li><b>Warranty:</b> Ten (10) year limited warranty mechanical components</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6200R-template.pdf?v=1704262246\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6200R Installation Template  (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
